# mimo-streak demo

Output mimo-streak.gif

# Show main heatmap
Type "mimo-streak"
Enter
Sleep 3s

# Show model breakdown
Type "mimo-streak models"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Show filtered model
Type "mimo-streak models mimo"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Show projects
Type "mimo-streak projects"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Show trends
Type "mimo-streak trends"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Show help
Type "mimo-streak --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s
